== s09 owner notice to old agency (broken)
== s10 merge tag (broken)
error content/placeholder [s10] Unfilled placeholder {customer_first_name} in email
  detail: The template still contains the placeholder, so readers see it instead of their data.
  fix: Check the tag's spelling against the plugin's list of tags, and that the data it needs exists when the message is sent.
  key: content/placeholder|Unfilled placeholder {customer_first_name} in email
== s10 merge tag SMS (broken)
error content/placeholder [s10s] Unfilled placeholder {first_name} in Twilio SMS
  detail: The template still contains the placeholder, so readers see it instead of their data.
  fix: Check the tag's spelling against the plugin's list of tags, and that the data it needs exists when the message is sent.
  key: content/placeholder|Unfilled placeholder {first_name} in Twilio SMS
== s11 PHP warning (broken)
error content/php-error [s11] PHP error printed in email
  detail: PHP Warning: Undefined variable $total (order.php line 42)
  fix: Fix the code the error points at, and turn display_errors off so errors never reach messages.
  key: content/php-error|PHP error printed in email
== s12 staging link (broken)
warning content/dev-link [s12] Email links to a development address (staging.shop.test)
  detail: 
  fix: Build links from the site's configured URL, not a hard-coded or local one.
  key: content/dev-link|Email links to a development address (staging.shop.test)
== s13 three-part SMS (broken)
notice sms/parts [s13] SMS needs more than one part
  detail: 3 parts (UCS-2); each part is charged
  fix: Keep SMS under 160 GSM-7 characters (70 with emoji or other Unicode).
  key: sms/parts|SMS needs more than one part
== s13 long SMS (broken)
warning sms/number [s13l] Message sent to a number that isn't in international format
  detail: 07700900123
  fix: Store and send numbers in E.164 form, e.g. +4915112345678.
  key: sms/number|Message sent to a number that isn't in international format
warning sms/parts [s13l] SMS needs more than 3 parts
  detail: 4 parts (GSM-7); each part is charged
  fix: Shorten the message, or avoid characters that force UCS-2 (emoji, curly quotes).
  key: sms/parts|SMS needs more than 3 parts
== s14 CRM webhook (broken)
warning webhook/signature [s14] WooCommerce webhook is sent without a signature
  detail: 
  fix: Set a secret on the webhook (WooCommerce → Settings → Advanced → Webhooks) so receivers can verify it.
  key: webhook/signature|WooCommerce webhook is sent without a signature
== s15 Zapier hook (good)
warning webhook/json [s15] Zapier webhook sends invalid JSON
  detail: 
  fix: The payload says it's JSON but doesn't parse; check how it's built (json_encode errors, stray output).
  key: webhook/json|Zapier webhook sends invalid JSON
== s16 CRM fails (broken)
error send/failed [s16] Webhook to crm.shop.test fails (HTTP 500)
  detail: Internal Server Error
  fix: Check the sender's settings (API key, SMTP login, endpoint URL) and the provider's error above.
  key: send/failed|Webhook to crm.shop.test fails (HTTP 500)
warning content/secret [s16] Webhook to crm.shop.test carries a credential in its body
  detail: 
  fix: Don't put API keys or passwords in payloads; send them in an Authorization header, or not at all.
  key: content/secret|Webhook to crm.shop.test carries a credential in its body
== s17 From domain (broken)
error content/placeholder [s17] Unfilled placeholder {{ order.id }} in email
  detail: The template still contains the placeholder, so readers see it instead of their data.
  fix: Check the tag's spelling against the plugin's list of tags, and that the data it needs exists when the message is sent.
  key: content/placeholder|Unfilled placeholder {{ order.id }} in email
warning content/encoding [s17] Garbled characters in email
  detail: found "â€™": text was encoded twice
  fix: Make sure the message is built and sent as UTF-8 (the mailer's charset and the template file's encoding).
  key: content/encoding|Garbled characters in email
warning email/no-subject [s17] Email has no subject
  detail: 
  fix: Give the notification a subject; many filters treat mail without one as spam.
  key: email/no-subject|Email has no subject
notice email/no-text [s17] Email has no plain-text part
  detail: 
  fix: Send a text alternative too; some clients and spam filters prefer it.
  key: email/no-text|Email has no plain-text part
notice email/from-domain [s17] Email is sent from another domain (mailer.example.org)
  detail: the site is shop.example.com
  fix: Send from an address on your own domain, or make sure its SPF, DKIM and DMARC cover this sender.
  key: email/from-domain|Email is sent from another domain (mailer.example.org)
== s19 real customer (broken)
warning seal/real-recipient [s19] Email really sent to an address outside the allowlist
  detail: jane.doe@gmail.com
  fix: Run sealed on staging (rhythm echo up), or add test recipients to allow_recipients.
  key: seal/real-recipient|Email really sent to an address outside the allowlist
